WEBVTT

00:02:57.913 --> 00:03:00.371
Main traans ke roop mein
bhee baahar aa rihi hoon

00:03:00.371 --> 00:03:01.871
Mera naya naam Micah hai

00:03:01.871 --> 00:03:03.829
Mere sarvanaam
hain vah, use, unake

00:03:03.829 --> 00:03:06.579
Yadi aapake paas mere
parivartan ya tvacha ke

00:03:06.579 --> 00:03:08.204
baare mein prashn hain

00:03:08.204 --> 00:03:09.996
meree naee jaanakaaree

00:03:09.996 --> 00:03:11.663
ke ek eemel bhejdo

00:03:11.663 --> 00:03:14.663
Meree tvacha bhee shushk hai,
lekin

00:03:14.663 --> 00:03:16.163
sanvedanasheel nahin hai

00:03:16.163 --> 00:03:18.538
Ham sab gadabad karenge

00:03:18.538 --> 00:03:19.704
khud bhee

00:03:19.704 --> 00:03:22.204
Isalie jab aise hota hain,
daren nain!

00:03:22.204 --> 00:03:23.954
Apane aap par daya karen

00:03:23.954 --> 00:03:26.288
kyonki ham ise ek 
saath jodate hain

00:03:26.288 --> 00:03:28.788
Main aisee jagah kaam karane
ke lie aabhaaree hoon

00:03:28.788 --> 00:03:31.371
jahaan main kisee bhe roopr
mein ashaj mahasoos hoon